      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability: removing unused imports, clarifying the `SYSTEM` case logic, and adding assertion messages.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed 10 unused imports, introduced a named `expectedSensitiveOnCurrentOS` variable to make the `SYSTEM` case logic explicit, and added assertion messages to each check so the intent of every assertion is immediately clear."
